@baseUrl = https://localhost:7066
# Po vytvoreni knihy nahradte bookId skutocnym ID z odpovede.
@bookId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Cisty starter: 200 a JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/weatherforecast

### U1: zoznam knih, 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books

### U1: vytvorenie, 201 + Location. Skopirujte ID do bookId.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Duna","author":"Frank Herbert","year":1965}

### U1: detail vytvorenej knihy, 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/{{bookId}}

### U1: chybajuci rok, 400; kniha nesmie pribudnut
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Duna","author":"Frank Herbert"}

### U1: null rok, 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Duna","author":"Frank Herbert","year":null}

### U1: rok mimo rozsahu, 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Duna","author":"Frank Herbert","year":1449}

### U1: kratky nazov, 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"D","author":"Frank Herbert","year":1965}

### U1: chyba bindingu Guid, 400 pri route {id}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/abc

### U1: platny neexistujuci Guid, 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### U2: uplna aktualizacia existujucej knihy, 204; spustite dvakrat
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/books/{{bookId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Duna – upravene vydanie","author":"Frank Herbert","year":1965}

### U2: chybal autor, 400; predchadzajucia hodnota zostane
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/books/{{bookId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Duna","year":1965}

### U2: overenie stavu po PUT, 200 a nezmenene ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/{{bookId}}

### U2: prve zmazanie 204, opakovane zmazanie 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/books/{{bookId}}

### U2: detail po zmazani, 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/{{bookId}}
